            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.41.22"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "22",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amahanga yose n’akoranywe, amoko yose n’ahūrire hamwe: ni nde muri bo yoshobora kubimenyekanisha, akatwereka ivyabayeh’ ubga mbere? Ni bazane ivyabona vyabo batsindishirizwe; canke ni bumve bemere, bati N’ivy’ ukuri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.41.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 41:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.44.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "44:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni mwebge vyabona vyanje, ni k’Uhoraho agize, n’abasavyi banje natoranije, kugira ngo mummenye kandi munyizere, kandi mutahure ko nd’ uwo ndi we: nta mana yigeze kubumbga hirya yanje, kandi nta yizonza mu nyuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ISA.45.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yes 45:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HOS.13.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Hos 13:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jewe, jewe nyene nd’ Uhoraho; kandi nta wundi Mukiza atari jewe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni jewe nabitāngāje, ni jewe nakijije, ni jewe nabimenyekanishije, kandi nta yindi mana yariho muri mwebge: ni co gituma ari mwebge vyabona vyanje, ni k’Uhoraho agize, kandi ni jewe Mana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.43.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.43.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 43:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
