        },
        {
          "text": "Ntiwanzaniye imyagazi y’ibimazi vyawe vyo kwosa, kandi ntiwanyubahishije ibimazi vyawe. Sinakugoje kunshikanira amashikanwa, sinakuruhishije imibavu. ",
